        <h2>Why Cold Therapy</h2>
        <p>Cold water immersion triggers controlled stress responses in the body. Repeated exposure builds resilience while providing immediate benefits: enhanced circulation, reduced inflammation, accelerated muscle recovery, improved energy levels, and stronger mental focus.</p>
        <p>Professional athletes and wellness enthusiasts worldwide use cold therapy as a cornerstone of their recovery routines. At just 2–10 minutes per session, the impact on performance and well-being is profound.</p>
