        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h4>Mental Resilience</h4>
          <p>Builds psychological toughness and emotional regulation through controlled exposure to manageable stress.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h4>Energy & Alertness</h4>
          <p>Boosts norepinephrine and dopamine levels, enhancing focus, mood, and sustained mental performance throughout the day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h4>Better Sleep</h4>
          <p>Regulates circadian rhythm and core body temperature, supporting deeper, more restorative sleep cycles.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
